        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "HEM (Hydraulic Excavator Mount) is the second heaviest mast TEI offers for installing micropiles up to 76 mm."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "See the brochure below for more information and <a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">contact us</a> if you have questions."
